<title>POLAND: Zloty fixed flat at -1.40 pct from parity rate.</title>
<headline>Zloty fixed flat at -1.40 pct from parity rate.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.4665 to the dollar, up from 3.4705 on Monday and at 1.8915 to the mark, down from 1.8800, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The central bank fixed the zloty at an average of -1.40 percent from the weighted dollar and mark parity rates, the same level as on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
